From 335e06aa1f2b868e225da798269b03edcdf7dcae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien MOYAUX <49562406+adrienm7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:25:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(windows): preserve desired features behind category
 masters

Keep user choices separate from effective runtime gates so disabled
categories remain editable and full saves retain explicit intent. Publish
only affected domains after durable acceptance and share admission with
tap-hold writes to avoid losing concurrent state changes.

Persist neutral feature values as deletions through the manifest contract.
Cover closed-master edits, mixed sparse saves, rollback, reactivation,
unrelated runtime refusals and cross-file tap-hold admission.
